## Memory: where the truth lives

- `context/brief.md`, `context/scope.md`, `context/timeline.md`: what was asked, what is in and out (and who owns the out), when.
- `docs/decisions.md`: every Committed decision and rule, with who decided and why. A rule without a source can't be safely challenged later.
- `records/handovers.md`: one entry per substantive session (the `handover` skill).
- **How much to apply on your own:** {{AUTONOMY}}
- **Write output to its file in the same turn you produce it.** Chat is not storage. When a file still carries a seed marker (an HTML comment beginning `status: seed`), replace the seed text with real content and remove the marker; delete a seed file for a step this project doesn't use.
- `[[ASK]]` markers are questions for a person, never fields to fill by inference.

